list.item:
—We have conceded in both ICBM and SLBM unequal numbers in the Soviet favor;
                        since we had no active offensive programs stopping the current Soviet
                        buildup was a key objective.

—to emphasize the importance of what has been accomplished already in
                        terms of creating a more stable strategic balance and in terms of
                        contributing to a better political relationship;

—to indicate that the tasks are not complete,
                        and the second round could be more important because we need to translate
                        current gains into more permanent arrangements;
